msgstr "redning;gendannelse;øjebliksbillede;adgangskode;filer;"

#: data/com.anduinos.RescueCenter.desktop:15
msgid ""
"Recover files, accounts, and snapshots from an offline AnduinOS installation"
msgstr ""
"Gendan filer, konti og øjebliksbilleder fra en offline AnduinOS-installation"

#: data/com.anduinos.RescueCenter.desktop:19
msgid ""
"Find installed AnduinOS systems from a Live session and perform carefully "
"scoped offline recovery operations."
msgstr ""
"Find installerede AnduinOS-systemer fra en Live-session, og udfør nøje "
"afgrænsede offlinegendannelseshandlinger."

